        <div class="subhead">首轮 67 秒循环（以开打为 0 秒，标明起读 → 落地）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+6 → +8 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:267618}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>排干体液 → 干枯</div><div class="s">2 秒读条（约 33 秒）· 6 秒自然持续约 66 万/跳（非中毒，清毒驱不了）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">冷却备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>挡不住干枯</b>（需刷过 90% 血解除），落地补星界压至约 37 万/跳帮治疗速抬，同时躲脚下酸液；星界冷却备选土元素。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+20 → +24 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:267639}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">燃烧腐蚀</div><div class="s">4 秒读条（约 33 秒）· 10 码火焰约 83 万并留火池</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192063}}" alt="">阵风</span><span class="act-note">提前出人群 10 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">提前出人群 10 码，落地瞬间阵风（或幽魂步）跳出火池；常规单吃，危急且满 90 秒才兜底星界。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+30 → +33 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1312146}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">觉醒猛击 → 未完成的木乃伊</div><div class="s">3 秒读条（约 67 秒）全团暗影约 103 万 · 召木乃伊读恶疾排放</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="or">未中排干备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">木乃伊出棺秒断恶疾排放。首轮未中排干可备选读条末开星界压至约 66 万（隔轮再交）；无星界轮（含排干交过的前两轮）满血接团减。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+60 → +63 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:267702}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">埋葬</div><div class="s">3 秒读条（约 67 秒）关输出进棺 · 拖延出制成的木乃伊</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">盯晃动棺材立刻点开</span></div>
