          <div class="row step" id="k-roar">
            <div class="when">P1 · 至提扎拉登场</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:269369}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">致命咆哮 / 凌空猛击 / 穿刺之矛</div><div class="s">莱班 4 秒恐惧（延续至 P2 首轮震地）· 达萨 8 码跳跃 · 天花板落矛</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="or">兜底</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:8143}}" alt="">战栗图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">莱班致命咆哮轮断至击杀（<b>P2 首轮震地期间还会再读一次</b>，漏断插战栗），躲莱班锥形、达萨 8 码跳与落矛；P1 镀金若先交星界，P2 按满 90 秒顺延接震地。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">P2 · 0 → +4.5 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303327}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>震地之跃（每 47 秒）</div><div class="s">提扎拉 4 秒读条后连跳 4 次 · 8 码物理约 91 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="act-note">立刻 8 码分散 · 首轮留断莱班</span></div>
            <div class="why">全队 8 码分散防吃双跳（首轮别忘断莱班咆哮）。物理不吃风幕，读条内预开星界压至约 60 万，隔轮（94 秒）再交；无牌轮满血吃团减。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">P2 · +15 → +21 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303267}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">镀金毁灭（每 47 秒）</div><div class="s">6 秒读条 · +21 秒火焰直击约 80 万 + 15 秒跳伤约 14 万/跳</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素（≥ 3 分）</span><span class="or">重排备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">满 3 分钟于读条中提前 1–3 秒交土元素抬血接直击（30 秒盖完跳伤）；危急改交星界则满 90 秒后再接震地。之后避开达萨 12 秒灼金正面火波并全程躲矛。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">P2 震地之跃单次吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">91.2 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:66.2%">60.4 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：满 90 秒隔轮预开星界接震地</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素于镀金读条提前交</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +24 限时录像的元素天赋，英雄天赋先知。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御与功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:381647}}" alt=""><div><b>位面旅行者</b><span>星界转移冷却缩到 90 秒，六个核心高压点与尾王隔轮震地全靠它排轴。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:370}}" alt=""><div><b>净化术</b><span>无冷却驱散敌方魔法增益，秒杀祖尔的爪牙、驱散队长壁垒的必点功能牌。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1279819}}" alt=""><div><b>始源羁绊</b><span>土元素不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%，填蛇之风、翻滚与镀金毁灭空档。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:355630}}" alt=""><div><b>风幕</b><span>风剪成功打断后 12 秒法术伤害 −15%，全本大量必断读条顺手白嫖法伤减免。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见微调：移动与控场多选<b>陷地图腾、阵风、战栗图腾</b>，也可按习惯或队伍分工改点<b>幽魂步、大地之盾（配元素环绕与塞拉赞恩的韧性）、治疗链、清毒图腾、妖术或治疗之泉图腾</b>。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>元素萨满 · 诸王之眠 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/1b9v7Z4FqkCwxpdX#fight=7">麦格拉斯蛮锤 +24 31:18</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/HG7dTNB6MDVf8hzq#fight=2">孤独咩 +24 31:55</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/GJgWMpTVHcwqkYtA#fight=1">一期一会 +24 32:05</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/WBZyHQ26atmCArq1#fight=24">Bondd +24 32:55</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/fTL69mCr2gkvBFpV#fight=13">Hearthjacke +24 33:00</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
